# ============================================================================
#  Vercel_version — static deployment .gitignore
#  This folder is meant to be pushed & deployed on its own (Vercel static site).
# ============================================================================

# --- Re-include the trained model (IMPORTANT) ---------------------------------
# The repository root .gitignore ignores *.onnx (to keep large training files
# out of git). This static deployment MUST ship the quantized model, so force
# it back in. Without these lines the deployed site has no model and breaks.
!*.onnx
!model/
!model/*.onnx

# --- Vercel / tooling ---------------------------------------------------------
.vercel/
node_modules/
*.log

# --- OS junk ------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Python (only the dev-only tools/convert_to_onnx.py lives here) -----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
